8aafea7aad71040529975981b66e9b9b.mp4?t=1692827753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Build your character and playstyle how you want - No Classes -No Hard Item restrictions<br></li><li> Procedural Stat based A.I. - Enemies grow more diverse and powerful as you level</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887440/extras/ef7dcc1f4f10eee3f3da13fccd42154a.poster.avif?t=1692827753\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887440/extras/ef7dcc1f4f10eee3f3da13fccd42154a.webm?t=1692827753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887440/extras/ef7dcc1f4f10eee3f3da13fccd42154a.mp4?t=1692827753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dungeons and Overworld Exploration</strong></h2> Journey through a fantasy overworld and delve into deadly dungeons to rescue the captured.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a hand crafted overworld full of life and dangers to discover<br></li><li> Delve into dark and ever-changing procedural dungeons<br></li><li> Rescue Villagers, Uncover Ancestral Lore, Learn Secrets that have been kept from you</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887440/extras/9017f628ec266f72fb74ba54b4a8b55a.poster.avif?t=1692827753\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887440/extras/9017f628ec266f72fb74ba54b4a8b55a.webm?t=1692827753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887440/extras/9017f628ec266f72fb74ba54b4a8b55a.mp4?t=1692827753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Find Spell Books and Runes to learn and upgrade Spells, Skills and Fighting Styles<br></li><li> Set out on an Epic Adventure every time you leave town in a true Open World</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Other Key Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Procedural dungeons</strong> - Explore a different dungeon every time<br></li><li><strong>Crafting System</strong> - Craft Weapons, Food, Potions, Runes and more<br></li><li><strong>Skill based Combat</strong> - Time your dodges, blocks, spells and attacks or you won't survive<br></li><li><strong>Customization</strong> - Customizable Death Screen, UI and Enemy Health Bars<br></li><li><strong>Multi-staged Boss fights</strong> - Fight Epic Bosses that evolve during the fight<br></li><li><strong>Extensive Weapons</strong> - Find, buy or forge 100's of Unique weapons<br></li><li><strong>4 Armor Slots</strong> - Mix and Match 100+ pieces of armor (Helmet, Chest, Legs and Gauntlets)<br></li><li><strong>Enhanced Condition System</strong> - Light your enemies on fire or Shock your enemies in place!</li></ul>",
